Update:

I continued downward until I got to Medusa.  There I found a peaceful
Titan.  Many charges of my magic harp later I had a pet Titan.  So I
took my Titan back up and let it kill everything!  I killed the potion
shk and then canceled everything that wasn't some kind of healing
potion, a 300 potion, or booze (needed that for my burnt CoMR didn't
have an expired spell at that point).
I cancelled everything else and got 14 potions of water, 2 potions of
fruit juice, and a 250 that I later realized was oil because acid
