I made holy water with a potion of holy water I found on the way down.
Blessed my Boh, unihorn, luckstone, and magic lamps.  The first magic
lamp gave me an angry djinn!  So I had to use the second for SDSM,
which I got.  I took my Titan back up further and killed more
shopkeepers and found quite a few vaults just by digging into empty
spaces on the map when I heard the sounds of a guard on patrol.  On D25
there is a nonaligned temple and I got my naked AC to 1.

I decided to take my Titan to the castle and *almost* made it across
